1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,800
The world's oldest noodles are 4,000 years old.

2
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:04,800
I'm your China Travel Expert.

3
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:07,400
They were dug up in Qinghai, China.

4
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:10,000
Sealed under three metres of earth by a flood.

5
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,800
Not wheat — they were made from millet.

6
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:15,400
Sorry, Italy: China had noodles first.

7
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:18,000
Double-tap if noodles are your desert-island food.

8
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,400
★ Expert Tip: try hand-pulled lamian — one dough, hundreds of strands.

9
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:24,400
Who really invented noodles — China or Italy? Fight below.
